# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`run()` returns after the workflow queues the job. Save the job ID so that you can [find the job from a new session](#find-a-job-from-a-new-session).\n"
msgstr "Nagbabalik ang `run()` pagkatapos i-queue ng workflow ang job. I-save ang job ID para mahanap mo ang [job mula sa bagong session](#find-a-job-from-a-new-session).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To choose which arguments a workflow accepts and check them before the job starts, see [Define inputs and outputs](/guides/managed-workflow-inputs-and-outputs).\n"
msgstr "Para piliin kung anong mga argument ang tinatanggap ng workflow at suriin ang mga ito bago magsimula ang job, tingnan ang [Define inputs and outputs](/guides/managed-workflow-inputs-and-outputs).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
